# Components

## Prefer composition
Build pages from `src/components/layout`, `src/components/sections`, `src/components/shared`, and `src/components/ui` (shadcn). Do not duplicate section markup across pages.

## Shared primitives
- `SectionTitle` — eyebrow + headline + optional description
- `FadeIn` / `StaggerChildren` — scroll reveal (respect `prefers-reduced-motion`)
- `CaseCard`, `TestimonialCard`, `Timeline`, `FinalCTA`, `ThemeToggle`
- Stats, FAQ, Process use shared data from `src/data`

## Motion
- Subtle fade-up, stagger, card lift (`hover:-translate-y-0.5`), navbar glass transition
- No excessive bounce, parallax overload, or autoplay gimmicks
- Framer Motion only through shared wrappers when possible

## Buttons & links
Use shadcn `Button` variants. Primary CTAs: Book Free Consultation. Secondary: View Success Stories / Contact.

## Large UI changes
For new pages or redesigns, propose a short plan and wait for approval before rewriting structure.
